  "sangamTamil": "முலைக்கண்ணும் முத்தும் முழுமெய்யும் புல்லும்\nஇலக்கணம் யாதும் அறியேன் - கலைக்கணம்\nவேங்கை ஦வ்ருஉம் நெறிசெலிய போலும்என்\nதீம்பாவை செய்த குறி.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The mother now aware of her daughter's flight, says: ‘My breast, my necklace of pearls, and my whole body she embraced ! I knew not what it portended. It was the sign, it seems, made by my lovely one that she was about to set out on the path where the herds of antelopes flee in fright from the tiger.'",
